{"id":"wb-3-237","name":"张衡墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"张衡墓","text":"张衡墓位于中华人民共和国河南省南阳市卧龙区石桥镇小石桥村，是为了纪念东汉时期科学家、文学家张衡而修建的陵墓。张衡墓为全国重点文物保护单位及全国科普教育基地。\n\n南阳市张衡博物馆共有馆藏文物1030件，三级以上藏品600余件，类别有石、陶、瓷、金银、铜铁、书画等。\n\n南阳文物保护单位列表\n南阳博物馆列表","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%A0%E8%A1%A1%E5%A2%93","revisionId":94116914,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94116914","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4762f943be310ffccc7a9b6c.jpg","title":"20251004_Tomb_of_Zhang_Heng_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20251004_Tomb_of_Zhang_Heng_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/20251004_Tomb_of_Zhang_Heng_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​南阳 张衡墓","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}